00:23:40.120 --> 00:23:41.750
Weirdo.

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:46.330
Say, do you know about the
commemoration time capsule...

00:23:46.390 --> 00:23:48.830
...buried at the closing
of the exposition?

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:53.090
Sure! You mean the one they're
going to dig up in the future?

00:23:53.170 --> 00:23:57.930
They say it will be the year 2000
when they open the first capsule.

00:23:58.270 --> 00:24:01.210
Wow. That's over 30 years from now...

00:24:02.180 --> 00:24:04.700
By the time it's dug up,
do you think we'll be...?

00:24:05.180 --> 00:24:06.870
Huh?

00:24:07.850 --> 00:24:12.220
U- Uh, I mean, I wonder what
the world will be like then?

00:24:13.520 --> 00:24:15.720
30 years from now, huh...?

00:24:15.790 --> 00:24:18.230
That's true. I bet...

00:24:19.190 --> 00:24:20.680
Bet what?

00:24:29.370 --> 00:24:36.540
THE END

00:24:42.160 --> 00:24:45.860
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:24:45.860 --> 00:24:49.730
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:24:49.830 --> 00:24:54.700
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:24:55.240 --> 00:24:58.080
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:24:58.080 --> 00:25:00.210
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:25:00.210 --> 00:25:05.380
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:25:05.380 --> 00:25:08.720
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:25:08.720 --> 00:25:13.350
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:25:14.060 --> 00:25:18.220
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:25:18.300 --> 00:25:22.860
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:25:23.330 --> 00:25:29.640
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
